HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.0", "Alchemist\n\nYou have taken control of the local Alchemist shop. It will provide you with one unit of Mercury per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.1", "Signpost\n\nA signpost reads:\n\n%s is near.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.2", "Buoy\n\nYour men spot a navigational buoy, confirming that you are on course.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.3", "Buoy\n\nYour men spot a navigational buoy, confirming that you are on course and increasing their morale.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.4", "Moisture congeals on the walls and trickles slowly down to the ground.  Except for the evidence of a battle, the cave is empty.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.5", "A large daemon emerges from the shadows and you attack. After an exhausting battle, you emerge victorious and receive 1000 experience points.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.6", "A large daemon emerges from the shadows and you attack. After an exhausting battle, you emerge victorious and receive 1000 experience points and an artifact.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.7", "A large daemon emerges from the shadows and you attack. After an exhausting battle, you emerge victorious and receive 1000 experience points and 2500 gold.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.8", "You are captured by a large daemon.  He offers to let you free for 2500 gold, otherwise he will devour you.  Do you pay?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.9", "Seeing that you do not have 2500 gold, the daemon slashes you with its claws, and the last thing you see is a red haze.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.10", "Daemon Cave\n\nThe cave is dank and musty.  Two large red eyes glow eerily within the blackness.  Do you wish to enter?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.11", "Chest\n\nAfter scouring the area, you fall upon a hidden treasure cache.  You may take the gold or distribute the gold to the peasants for experience.  Do you wish to keep the gold?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.12", "Faerie Ring\n\nYou enter the faerie ring, but nothing happens.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.13", "Faerie Ring\n\nUpon entering the mystical faerie ring, your army gains luck for its next battle.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.14", "Campfire\n\nRansacking an enemy camp, you discover a hidden cache of treasures.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.15", "Fountain\n\nYou drink from the enchanted fountain, but nothing happens.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.16", "Fountain\n\nAs you drink the sweet water, you gain luck for your next battle.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.17", "Gazebo\n\nAn old knight appears on the steps of the gazebo. \"I am sorry, my liege, I have taught you all I can.\"")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.18", "Gazebo\n\nAn old knight appears on the steps of the gazebo. \"My liege, I will teach you all that I know to aid you in your travels.\"")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.19", "Genie Lamp\n\nYou stumble upon a dented and tarnished lamp lodged deep in the earth. Do you wish to rub the lamp?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.20", "Graveyard\n\nYou tentatively approach the burial ground of ancient warriors.  Do you want to search the graves?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.21", "Upon defeating the ghosts you spend several hours searching the graves and find nothing.  Such a despicable act reduces your army's morale.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.22", "Upon defeating the ghosts you search the graves and find something!")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.23", "Hut\n\nA group of goblins with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.24", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.25", "Hut\n\nAs you approach the goblin dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.26", "Thatched Hut\n\nA group of peasants with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.27", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.28", "Thatched Hut\n\nAs you approach the peasant dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.29", "Cottage\n\nA group of archers with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.30", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.31", "Cottage\n\nAs you approach the archer dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.32", "Cottage\n\nA group of dwarves with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.33", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.34", "Cottage\n\nAs you approach the dwarves' dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.35", "Thatched Hut\n\nA group of peasants with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.36", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.37", "Thatched Hut\n\nAs you approach the peasant dwelling you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.38", "Dragon City\n\nYou have reached Dragon City, famous for its wealth and danger. Do you wish to attack?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.39", "You have conquered the mighty dragons. In homage to you, they offer 1000 gold a day to your cause, and will defend the city for you in case of attack.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.40", "Lighthouse\n\nThe lighthouse is now under your control, and all of your ships will now move further each turn.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.41", "Mill\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I am sorry, there is no gold currently available.  Please try again next week.\"")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.42", "Mill\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I have been working very hard to provide you with this gold, come back next week for more.\"")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.43", "Ore Mine\n\nYou gain control of an ore mine. It will provide you with two units of ore per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.44", "Sulfur Mine\n\nYou gain control of a sulfur mine. It will provide you with one unit of sulfur per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.45", "Crystal Mine\n\nYou gain control of a crystal mine. It will provide you with one unit of crystal per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.46", "Gem Mine\n\nYou gain control of a gem mine. It will provide you with one unit of gems per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.47", "Gold Mine\n\nYou gain control of a gold mine. It will provide you with 1000 gold per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.48", "Followers\n\nA group of %s with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.49", "Insulted by your refusal of their offer, the monsters attack!")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.50", "Obelisk\n\nYou come upon an obelisk made from a type of stone you have never seen before.  Staring at it intensely, the smooth surface suddenly changes to an inscription.  The inscription is a piece of a lost ancient map.  Quickly you copy down the piece and the inscription vanishes as abruptly as it had appeared.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.51", "Obelisk\n\nYou have already been to this obelisk.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.52", "Oasis\n\nYou spot an oasis, but the well is dry and you depart empty-handed.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.53", "Oasis\n\nA nomad merchant, traveling on foot, hails you and says his horse had spooked and left him stranded. For safe passage he takes your army to an oasis, raising your morale for one battle.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.54", "You find a small quantity of %s.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.55", "Sawmill\n\nYou gain control of a sawmill. It will provide you with two units of wood per day.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.56", "Shrine\n\nWithin the ornate shrine sits a blind seer. After explaining the intent of your journey, the seer activates his crystal ball, allowing you to see the strengths and weaknesses of your opponents.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.57", "Shrine\n\nNestled in a small hidden shrine is an ancient wooden altar.  Upon the altar, a golden plaque bears an inscription with the secret to the ancient magical spell ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.58", "Shipwreck\n\nThe rotting hulk of a great pirate ship creaks eerily as it is pushed against the rocks.  Do you wish to search the shipwreck? ")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.59", "Upon defeating the ghosts you spend several hours sifting through the debris and find nothing.  Such a despicable act reduces your army's morale.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.60", "Upon defeating the ghosts you sift through the debris and find something!")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.61", "Statue\n\nA large statue of an angel towers above you. Abruptly, the angel's eyes open and your troops celebrate a great increase in their morale.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.62", "Statue\n\nA large statue of an angel towers above you. Your army encircles the statue, but there appears to be nothing special about it.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.63", "Tents\n\nA group of tattered tents, billowing in the sandy wind, beckons you.  The tents are unoccupied.  Perhaps more nomads will be here later.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.64", "Tents\n\nA group of tattered tents, billowing in the sandy wind, beckons you.  Do you wish to have any nomads join you during your travels?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.65", "Wagon\n\nA colorful rogues' wagon stands empty here.  Perhaps more rogues will be here later.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.66", "Wagon\n\nDistant sounds of music and laughter draw you to a colorful wagon housing rogues.  Do you wish to have any rogues join your army?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.67", "Whirlpool\n\nA whirlpool engulfs your ship.  Some of your army has fallen overboard.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.68", "Windmill\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I am sorry, there are no resources currently available. Please try again next week.\"")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.69", "Windmill\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I have been working very hard to provide you with these resources, come back next week for more.\"")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.70", "Artifact\n\nYou come upon an ancient artifact.  As you reach for it, a pack of Rogues leap out of the brush to guard their stolen loot.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.71", "Artifact\n\nA leprechaun offers you the %s for the small price of 2000 gold.  Do you wish to buy this artifact?")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.72", "Insulted by your refusal of his generous offer, the leprechaun stamps his foot ferociously and vanishes.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.73", "You try to pay the leprechaun, but realize that you don't have 2000 gold.  The leprechaun stamps his foot and ignores you.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.74", "Upon defeating the Rogues, you search their corpses and discover the %s.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.75", "Skeleton\n\nYou come upon the remains of an unfortunate adventurer.  Searching through the tattered clothing, you find nothing.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.76", "Skeleton\n\nYou come upon the remains of an unfortunate adventurer.  Searching through the tattered clothing, you find")
