HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupDCBaudHelp.0", "Use a 2400 baud connection speed. \n\nNote: In general, computers with the older UART 8250 chip should use 19200 baud, and computers with the newer UART 16550 chip should use 38400 baud.  When in doubt, try slower speeds first, and if they work, then try faster speeds.  Most computers made in 1994 or later have a UART 16550 chip.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupDCBaudHelp.1", "Use a 9600 baud connection speed. \n\nNote: In general, computers with the older UART 8250 chip should use 19200 baud, and computers with the newer UART 16550 chip should use 38400 baud.  When in doubt, try slower speeds first, and if they work, then try faster speeds.  Most computers made in 1994 or later have a UART 16550 chip.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupDCBaudHelp.2", "Use a 19200 baud connection speed.\n\nNote: In general, computers with the older UART 8250 chip should use 19200 baud, and computers with the newer UART 16550 chip should use 38400 baud.  When in doubt, try slower speeds first, and if they work, then try faster speeds.  Most computers made in 1994 or later have a UART 16550 chip.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupDCBaudHelp.3", "Use a 38400 baud connection speed.\n\nNote: In general, computers with the older UART 8250 chip should use 19200 baud, and computers with the newer UART 16550 chip should use 38400 baud.  When in doubt, try slower speeds first, and if they work, then try faster speeds.  Most computers made in 1994 or later have a UART 16550 chip.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupDCBaudHelp.4", "Cancel back to the main menu.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupBaudHelp.0", "Use a 2400 baud connection speed. \n\nNote: For a 14400 baud modem, use the 19200 baud speed.  For a 28800 baud modem, use the 38400 baud speed.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupBaudHelp.1", "Use a 9600 baud connection speed. \n\nNote: For a 14400 baud modem, use the 19200 baud speed.  For a 28800 baud modem, use the 38400 baud speed.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupBaudHelp.2", "Use a 19200 baud connection speed.\n\nNote: For a 14400 baud modem, use the 19200 baud speed.  For a 28800 baud modem, use the 38400 baud speed.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupBaudHelp.3", "Use a 38400 baud connection speed.\n\nNote: For a 14400 baud modem, use the 19200 baud speed.  For a 28800 baud modem, use the 38400 baud speed.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gSetupBaudHelp.4", "Cancel back to the main menu.")
