HOMM1_MESSAGE("event.artifact.full", "You cannot pick up this artifact, you already have a full load!")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.4", "After rescuing a sorceress from a cursed tomb, she rewards your heroism with an exquisite jeweled necklace.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.5", "While searching through the rubble of a caved in mine, you free a group of trapped dwarves.  Grateful, the leader gives you a golden bracelet.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.6", "A cry of pain leads you to a centaur, caught in a trap.  Upon setting the creature free, he hands you a small pouch.  Emptying the contents, you find a dazzling jeweled ring.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.7", "Alongside the remains of a burnt witch lies a beautiful broach, intricately designed.  Approaching the corpse with caution, you add the broach to your inventory.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.8", "Freeing a virtuous maiden from the clutches of an evil overlord, you are granted a Medal of Valor by the King's herald.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.9", "After saving a young boy from a vicious pack of wolves, you return him to his father's manor.  The grateful nobleman awards you with a Medal of Courage.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.10", "After freeing a princess of a neighboring kingdom from the evil clutches of despicable slavers, she awards you with a Medal of Honor.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.11", "Ridding the countryside of the hideous minotaur who made a sport of eating noblemen's knights, you are honored with the Medal of Distinction.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.12", "You stumble upon a medal lying alongside the empty road.  Adding the medal to your inventory, you become aware that you have acquired the undesirable Fizbin of Misfortune, greatly decreasing your army's morale.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.13", "During a sudden storm, a bolt of lightning strikes a tree, splitting it.  Inside the tree you find a mysterious mace.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.14", "You encounter the infamous Black Knight!  After a grueling duel ending in a draw, the knight, out of respect, offers you a pair of armored gauntlets.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.15", "A glint of golden light catches your eye.  Upon further investigation, you find a golden helm hidden under a bush.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.16", "A clumsy Giant has killed himself with his own flail.  Knowing your superior skill with this weapon, you confidently remove the spectacular flail from the fallen giant.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.17", "Walking through the ruins of an ancient walled city, you find the instrument of the city's destruction, an elaborately crafted ballista.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.18", "A stone statue of a warrior holds a silver shield.  As you remove the shield, the statue crumbles into dust.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.19", "As you are walking along a narrow path, a nearby bush suddenly bursts into flames.  Before your eyes the flames become the image of a beautiful woman.  She holds out a magnificent sword to you.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.20", "You see a silver axe embedded deeply in the ground.  After several unsuccessful attempts by your army to remove the axe, you tightly grip the handle of the axe and effortlessly pull it free.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.21", "A gang of rogues is sifting through the possessions of dead warriors.  Scaring off the scavengers, you note the rogues had overlooked a beautiful breastplate.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.22", "Before you appears a levitating glass case with a scroll, perched upon a bed of crimson velvet.  At your touch, the lid opens and the scroll floats into your awaiting hands.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.23", "Visiting a local wiseman, you explain the intent of your journey.  He reaches into a sack and withdraws a yellowed scroll and hands it to you.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.24", "You come across the remains of an ancient Druid.  Bones, yellowed with age, peer from the ragged folds of her robe.  Searching the robe, you discover a scroll hidden in the folds.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.25", "Mangled bones, yellowed with age, peer from the ragged folds of a dead Druid's robe.  Searching the robe, you discover a scroll hidden within.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.26", "A little leprechaun dances gleefully around a magic sack.  Seeing you approach, he stops in mid-stride.  The little man screams and stamps his foot ferociously, vanishing into thin air.  Remembering the old leprechaun saying 'Finders Keepers', you grab the sack and leave.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.27", "A noblewoman, separated from her traveling companions, asks for your help.  After escorting her home, she rewards you with a bag filled with gold.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.28", "In your travels, you find a leather purse filled with gold that once belonged to a great warrior king who had the ability to transform any inanimate object into gold.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.29", "A nomad trader seeks protection from a tribe of goblins.  For your assistance, he gives you a finely crafted pair of boots made from the softest leather.  Looking closely, you see fascinating ancient carvings engraved on the leather.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.30", "Discovering a pair of beautifully beaded boots made from the finest and softest leather, you thank the anonymous donor and add the boots to your inventory.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.31", "A traveling merchant offers you a rabbit's foot, made of gleaming silver fur, for safe passage.  The merchant explains the charm will increase your luck in combat.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.32", "An ensnared unicorn whinnies in fright.  Murmuring soothing words, you set her free.  Snorting and stamping her front hoof once, she gallops off.  Looking down you see a golden horseshoe.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.33", "You have captured a mischievous imp who has been terrorizing the region.  In exchange for his release, he rewards you with a magical coin.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.34", "In the middle of a patch of dead and dry vegetation, to your surprise you find a healthy green four-leaf clover.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.35", "An old man claiming to be an inventor asks you to try his latest invention.  He then hands you a compass.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.36", "An old sea captain is being tortured by ogres.  You save him, and in return he rewards you with a wondrous instrument to measure the distance of a star.")
HOMM1_MESSAGE("table.gArtifactEvent.37", "The Magic Book  ??????")
